        text: 'A beverage plant ran a criticality workshop on 350 assets. Result: 210 are class A, “critical”.\n\nAmong them: the filler (the bottleneck, no backup), two parallel labellers of which one can carry the full line speed, an air compressor with a standby unit next to it, and a pallet wrapper (it wraps film around finished pallets) with a manual workaround. The maintenance manager wants to put all 210 A assets on monthly vibration monitoring.',
